Z||000008||Black88GT||01-14-2001||02:39 PM||||Hmm Cliff I beg to differ, some people have had encounters with God.  One example from the Bible being Saul of Tarsus, later changed his name to Paul, but you probably already know that.  Not to get into a God debate or anything.  Also, UFO's aren't exactly like God.  I mean yeah people "see" them, but what exactly are they seeing?  Gov't technology, Aliens, ?? Thats the thing, its dumb for people to say they don't believe in UFO's, because everyone knows UFO's exist, its whether or not they believe the UFO's are from this planet or another thats the great debate.<P>About the UFO thing, I think that the gov't is covering it up, however they are covering up their own technology.  I don't think people from beyond this universe are visiting us, not saying its not possible but I doubt it.  Who really knows?  It would be cool to learn how to explore space further then what we have.  Our technology is limited right now.  Hopefully in my life time we will be able to visit other Solar Systems...  <P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
